Brand: {{brand.brand_name}} — {{brand.brand_summary}}
Picks: {{inputs.picks}}
Shared outcome: {{inputs.why}}
CTA: {{inputs.cta}}

Write three 5-second silent b-roll shots, each showing one pick being used on a desk or screen. For each write `frame_prompt` and `motion_prompt`, both with no text in the imagery. `overlays` has exactly 4 entries: a top hook from 0 to 3 seconds and one bottom label for each beat. Each label begins with 1, 2, or 3. Include start/end in seconds and position top or bottom.
